Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|RSS|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site add Blank CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And SitePageNavigator goto Pages
		|page|Public Pages|
	Then Page add
		|pageName|Site Page Name|

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Add Feed Between Feeds
Priority: 3
	Given these properties
		|testray.component.names|RSS|
	When Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Site Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|RSS Publisher|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletName|RSS Publisher|
		|portletOption|Configuration|
	And RSS add Feed
		|feedRowIndexNumber|0|
		|feedTitle|Technology|
		|feedUrlLink|http://rss.nytimes.com/services/xml/rss/nyt/Technology.xml|
	And PortletEntry save
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Site Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletName|RSS Publisher|
		|portletOption|Configuration|
	And RSS add Feed
		|buttonRowIndexNumber|1|
		|feedRowIndexNumber|2|
		|feedTitle|Latimes > Technology News|
		|feedUrlLink|http://www.latimes.com/business/technology/rss2.0.xml|
	And PortletEntry save
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Site Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletName|RSS Publisher|
		|portletOption|Configuration|
	And RSS add Feed
		|buttonRowIndexNumber|1|
		|feedRowIndexNumber|3|
		|feedTitle|Reuters > Sports News|
		|feedUrlLink|http://feeds.reuters.com/reuters/sportsNews|
	And PortletEntry save
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Site Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And RSS view Display Feed Title
		|feedTitle|Technology|
	And RSS view Display Feed Title
		|feedTitle|Reuters > Sports News|
	Then RSS view Display Feed Title
		|feedTitle|Latimes > Technology News|
Scenario: Add Feed With Wrong Url
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|testray.component.names|RSS|
	When Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Site Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|RSS Publisher|
