		|portletName|RSS Publisher|
		|portletOption|Configuration|
	And RSS add Feed
		|feedRowIndexNumber|0|
		|feedTitle|General Announcement|
		|feedUrlLink|www.theverge.com/rss/index.xml|
	And RSS view Warning Message Display
		|errorMessage|The following are invalid URLs: www.theverge.com/rss/index.xml.|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Site Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And RSS view Delete Feed
		|feedTitle|General Announcement|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletName|RSS Publisher|
		|portletOption|Configuration|
	And RSS add Feed
		|feedRowIndexNumber|0|
		|feedTitle|General Announcement|
		|feedUrlLink|http://www.theverge.com/rss/index.xml|
	And PortletEntry save
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Site Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	Then RSS view Display Feed Title
		|feedTitle|General Announcement|
Scenario: Add RSS Feed
