Scenario: Add Web Content Feed
Priority: 3
	Given these properties
		|testray.component.names|Asset Publisher,RSS|
	When Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Add CP
	And WebContent add CP
		|webContentContent|Web Content Content|
		|webContentTitle|Web Content Title|
	And PortletEntry publish
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Add Feed
	And WebContent add Feed
		|description|WC Feed Description|
		|feedContent|Content(ddm-text-html)|
		|feedTitle|WC Feed Title|
		|feedType|RSS 2.0|
		|structureName|Basic Web Content|
		|targetFriendlyUrl|/web/guest/home|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Edit Feed
		|feedName|WC Feed Title|
	And these variables
		|rssFeedUrl||
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Site Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|RSS Publisher|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletName|RSS Publisher|
		|portletOption|Configuration|
	And RSS add Feed
		|feedRowIndexNumber|0|
		|feedTitle|Web Content Feed Title|
		|feedUrlLink|${rssFeedUrl}|
	And PortletEntry save
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Site Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And RSS view Display Feed Title
		|feedTitle|Web Content Feed Title|
	Then RSS view Feed Content
		|feedEntryContent|Web Content Content|
		|feedEntryTitle|Web Content Title|
